WEBVTT

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.969
"Shiomi Academy General Library"

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:25.150
Oh, another one!

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.402
This is the tenth one...

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.112
"Borrower's Name: Kyotaro Kakei"

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:31.990
Kakei... Kyotaro...

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:36.203
I wonder if I'll meet him someday...

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:45.254
"My feelings have not
changed since we first met!

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:48.507
I want to accept you no matter how you are."

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:53.637
"Thank you. You have
taught me something important.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:56.598
I need to be true to myself, too.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.856
As long as I have you, I'll be fine.

00:01:03.856 --> 00:01:06.859
Please, stay with me forever."

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.571
Kakei, what are you saying?

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:15.242
What do you mean? I'm just
reading the lines you wrote, Kanasuke.

00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:19.329
I'll have to rewrite this scene, after all!

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:22.207
I know for sure now that we've acted it out.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:27.087
I didn't think you'd work
so hard on this, Kanasuke.

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.926
Actually, I've always been
interested in doing this.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:38.765
My life has become nothing
because of your precise critiques, though.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.476
It's pretty good for your first time.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:44.730
The subject matter is
good for a beach event, too.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:47.024
Is that a compliment...?

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:51.653
I hope it turns out okay... What if
no one laughs during the performance?

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:55.282
Even if it was a job,
it's just supposed to be fun little skit,

00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:57.743
so as long as it's amusing, it should be fine.

00:01:57.743 --> 00:02:00.537
It's not like you to be so uncertain, Kanasuke.

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:06.960
It's not like me... is it...?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.754
Kanasuke?

00:02:08.754 --> 00:02:10.506
It's nothing!

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:15.886
On the day of the performance, I will make
the audience laugh so hard they can't stop!

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.483
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:32.236
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:02:32.236 --> 00:02:37.574
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:02:37.574 --> 00:02:43.038
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:02:43.038 --> 00:02:44.414
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:48.335
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:02:48.335 --> 00:02:51.171
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:53.841
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:57.886
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:03.517
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:03:03.517 --> 00:03:04.643
<i>All Right</i>

00:03:04.643 --> 00:03:07.855
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:03:07.855 --> 00:03:10.691
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:11.692
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:03:11.692 --> 00:03:15.362
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:03:15.362 --> 00:03:21.285
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:24.121
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:03:24.121 --> 00:03:27.833
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:35.591
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.938
"Episode 8: The Magic Book"

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:52.941
"Shiomi Academy Unofficial Clubs Present"
"The Fastest Opening of the Beach Season Festival!!"

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.527
This method of swimming is
called the "tail feather extension."

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:58.739
I don't wanna see a guy in a<i> fundoshi...</i>

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:02.409
"Library Club Skit: 'The Queen's New Clothes'"
Hey, let's go watch the next play.

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:15.964
The large-chested queen, who did
not want to admit that she was foolish,

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:19.468
was tricked by a swindler.

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:22.137
Even though there wasn't
a pretty dress anywhere,

00:04:22.137 --> 00:04:24.431
In front of those drooping breasts,

00:04:24.431 --> 00:04:27.518
not a single person told the truth.

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:31.980
So <i>this </i>is a hierarchical society!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:37.194
Prince! Please look at those
two in their charming dresses!

00:04:38.237 --> 00:04:39.780
Dresses...?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.198
No way...

00:04:41.198 --> 00:04:45.160
The queen and the princess
are only wearing underwear...

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.330
To tell you the truth,
these dresses were specially made!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.250
They are dresses that the foolish cannot see!

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.626
What did you say?

00:04:52.626 --> 00:04:56.004
Don't tell me you cannot see it, Your Highness?

00:04:56.004 --> 00:04:57.047
That can't be!

00:04:57.047 --> 00:05:01.134
The man we have accepted
as the next king is no fool!

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:03.554
It is as mother says.

00:05:03.554 --> 00:05:07.641
There is no way the man
who will be my husband is a fool.

00:05:07.641 --> 00:05:11.436
How about it, Prince? Will you be
wed to me instead of the princess?

00:05:11.436 --> 00:05:13.939
Mother, please stop your joking.

00:05:13.939 --> 00:05:16.483
Prince! Please look only at me!

00:05:16.483 --> 00:05:17.943
Right...

00:05:17.943 --> 00:05:21.196
My eyes don't see anything resembling a dress...

00:05:21.196 --> 00:05:24.366
It looks like I am a fool...

00:05:24.366 --> 00:05:28.036
However, I feel like that
might not be too bad, either.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.580
This is amazing!

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:32.875
The comical queen domineering in her nakedness!

00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:35.377
No one can go against her!

00:05:35.377 --> 00:05:37.921
Thanks to that, I'm raking in the dough!

00:05:37.921 --> 00:05:41.842
Now, you must also wear
these wonderful clothes, prince!

00:05:41.842 --> 00:05:43.802
Now what?

00:05:43.802 --> 00:05:48.140
Would even Prince Charming fall
victim to the words of the stupid queen?

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:49.558
But it's all right.

00:05:49.558 --> 00:05:52.144
I will save him!

00:05:52.936 --> 00:05:54.897
The queen is naked!

00:05:54.897 --> 00:05:58.775
Prince! Don't be led astray by lumps of fat!

00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:15.834
This is...

00:06:15.834 --> 00:06:18.378
You perverted prince!

00:06:22.299 --> 00:06:25.469
"The water planet has..."

00:06:29.598 --> 00:06:31.099
"Heavily burdened"

00:06:31.808 --> 00:06:34.144
It's not your fault, Kana.

00:06:34.144 --> 00:06:37.606
I had hoped...

00:06:37.606 --> 00:06:42.736
...for a future where the play went
well and people said it was funny...

00:06:42.736 --> 00:06:45.155
This is my punishment, huh?

00:06:45.155 --> 00:06:48.784
To show off in a bit part...

00:06:48.784 --> 00:06:52.037
I can't bear to face Sakuraba now...

00:06:52.037 --> 00:06:53.288
Kana...

00:06:53.288 --> 00:06:56.542
But it was fun writing it, wasn't it?

00:06:57.626 --> 00:07:00.003
I had fun, anyway.

00:07:04.007 --> 00:07:08.595
Aw, man. What am I depressed about, anyway?

00:07:08.595 --> 00:07:10.389
Suzuki's in charge of the jokes!

00:07:10.389 --> 00:07:12.641
If we got laughs, isn't that enough?

00:07:14.726 --> 00:07:16.603
Hey!

00:07:22.234 --> 00:07:23.819
Kana!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.243
Kakei?

00:07:31.243 --> 00:07:33.954
Don't try too hard.

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:37.332
'Kay?

00:07:37.332 --> 00:07:38.750
O-Okay...

00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:50.679
Oh, there... that feels good...

00:07:50.679 --> 00:07:52.723
A sweet Kana is cute...

00:07:52.723 --> 00:07:55.309
I'm not being sweet...

00:07:55.309 --> 00:07:58.353
Our upperclassman was cool today, wasn't he?

00:07:58.353 --> 00:08:03.233
Oh, the meat Takamine
cooked was delicious, wasn't it?

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:07.362
I love watching a man cook meat!

00:08:07.362 --> 00:08:10.157
Kana, do you like Kakei?

00:08:11.408 --> 00:08:13.911
Wh-What're you asking out of the blue--?

00:08:13.911 --> 00:08:16.747
Are you trying to hide something from me?

00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:23.921
I don't have the right to have anyone like me.

00:08:23.921 --> 00:08:25.881
Kana...?

00:08:25.881 --> 00:08:30.219
But the Library Club accepted me the way I am.

00:08:30.219 --> 00:08:34.181
I didn't think I'd be such
good friends with you, either, Senri.

00:08:34.181 --> 00:08:36.058
It makes me really happy.

00:08:37.267 --> 00:08:38.977
Hey, Kana...

00:08:38.977 --> 00:08:41.813
I like you, Kana.

00:08:41.813 --> 00:08:45.359
Do I need a reason or a right to feel that way?

00:08:46.777 --> 00:08:50.531
Senri... Say that one more time!

00:08:52.908 --> 00:08:54.618
No!

00:08:55.452 --> 00:08:57.746
You finally understand my feelings!

00:08:57.746 --> 00:09:00.040
Let's go over the pink wall together!

00:09:01.375 --> 00:09:04.002
Jeez, that's not what I meant.

00:09:07.631 --> 00:09:09.049
Shiomi Festival?

00:09:09.049 --> 00:09:10.759
It's our school festival.

00:09:10.759 --> 00:09:13.387
Everyone gets really into it every year.

00:09:13.387 --> 00:09:17.850
We want to stand on the main stage
of the Shiomi Festival this year,

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:23.021
so we held the beach season event so the
student council could see what we could do,

00:09:23.021 --> 00:09:24.773
but they said that wasn't enough...

00:09:24.773 --> 00:09:26.650
Oh no...

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:34.199
I guess an unofficial club like us
shouldn't even try for the main stage...

00:09:34.199 --> 00:09:35.826
That's not true!

00:09:35.826 --> 00:09:39.705
"Student Council Room"
Let's go ask the student council again!

00:09:39.705 --> 00:09:42.499
I'm Takigawa, the vice president.

00:09:42.499 --> 00:09:46.253
She is responsible for the
paperwork for the Shiomi Festival,

00:09:46.253 --> 00:09:48.422
so I had her join us.

00:09:48.422 --> 00:09:52.176
Regarding the matter of increasing the
amount of presentation space at the festival,

00:09:52.176 --> 00:09:55.804
our conclusion is that
it is physically impossible.

00:09:55.804 --> 00:09:57.931
Then there is no room for negotiation.

00:09:57.931 --> 00:10:01.143
We came here for a discussion.

00:10:01.143 --> 00:10:05.981
The student council is operating with
all the students in the school in mind.

00:10:05.981 --> 00:10:09.943
If we increase the number of stages and
there is an accident because of lack of security,

00:10:09.943 --> 00:10:12.154
will the Library Club be responsible for that?

00:10:12.154 --> 00:10:14.656
Th-That's...

00:10:14.656 --> 00:10:17.868
Takigawa, that's enough.

00:10:17.868 --> 00:10:20.829
We will examine this matter
a little more on our part.

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:23.290
Let's leave it at that for today.

00:10:23.916 --> 00:10:27.336
I understand. Please do what you can.

00:10:30.339 --> 00:10:31.757
Aoi.

00:10:31.757 --> 00:10:34.551
Showing attitude like that is not good.

00:10:34.551 --> 00:10:38.805
You had a sound argument,
but other people cannot understand.

00:10:38.805 --> 00:10:40.307
It's fine.

00:10:40.307 --> 00:10:43.519
I can deal with the Library Club by myself.

00:10:43.519 --> 00:10:45.729
Don't worry.

00:10:45.729 --> 00:10:49.775
Well, the vice president's argument was sound.

00:10:49.775 --> 00:10:50.943
What should we do?

00:10:50.943 --> 00:10:54.571
Should we wait for the student
council to do something, or...?

00:10:54.571 --> 00:10:57.199
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:10:57.199 --> 00:11:01.411
It's true that just waiting isn't like us.

00:11:01.411 --> 00:11:02.746
What do you think?

00:11:02.746 --> 00:11:05.123
Yeah, let's try to do what we can.

00:11:06.542 --> 00:11:10.003
Strike while the iron is hot.
Let's keep those ideas coming.

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:13.131
First, we have to increase
public awareness of the unofficial clubs.

00:11:13.131 --> 00:11:15.968
I wonder if we can have
an event inside the school...

00:11:15.968 --> 00:11:20.222
If we succeed with that, maybe the
student council will accept them, too.

00:11:20.222 --> 00:11:21.890
Um...

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:27.563
Do you think that'll work? If we fail...

00:11:27.563 --> 00:11:28.522
Kana?

00:11:28.522 --> 00:11:31.567
What's wrong, Kanasuke? That's not like you.

00:11:34.695 --> 00:11:35.946
Yeah, you're right!

00:11:35.946 --> 00:11:38.949
Man, that festival thing has my blood boiling!

00:11:38.949 --> 00:11:41.493
Let's do a Library Club Fest!

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:43.620
Master Giza wants to do it, too!

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.163
Sounds good!

00:11:45.163 --> 00:11:48.041
Kana, aren't you allergic...?

00:11:48.792 --> 00:11:51.545
Ah, I forgot!

00:11:51.545 --> 00:11:54.882
It's so itchy!

00:11:54.882 --> 00:11:56.383
"Nurse's Office"

00:11:56.383 --> 00:11:59.761
So itchy! I want to scratch it off!

00:11:59.761 --> 00:12:01.638
You have to bear it.

00:12:01.638 --> 00:12:05.225
You don't want to leave scars
on those cute arms of yours.

00:12:13.775 --> 00:12:16.653
I feel better now, Shirasaki.

00:12:16.653 --> 00:12:19.198
This is all I can do.

00:12:19.198 --> 00:12:22.826
If it helped you a little, I'm glad.

00:12:24.036 --> 00:12:28.290
I'm so lucky...

00:12:31.293 --> 00:12:33.754
Kanasuke!

00:12:33.754 --> 00:12:35.589
Are your arms okay?

00:12:35.589 --> 00:12:37.508
Yes, as you can see!

00:12:37.508 --> 00:12:40.093
I received some of Shirasaki's healing power!

00:12:40.093 --> 00:12:42.012
Don't worry about me!

00:12:42.012 --> 00:12:45.307
Kanasuke, you're trying
too hard again, aren't you?

00:12:45.307 --> 00:12:48.477
I am not. Don't say that, Kakei.

00:12:48.477 --> 00:12:52.940
Liar. The usual Kanasuke is better at hiding it.

00:12:54.191 --> 00:12:57.110
Is what happened before still bothering you?

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:59.821
What about you, Kakei? What's wrong?

00:12:59.821 --> 00:13:02.866
Up until now, you pretended not to notice.

00:13:02.866 --> 00:13:06.370
You're not acting like yourself.

00:13:08.121 --> 00:13:09.706
I'm sorry.

00:13:12.668 --> 00:13:16.380
I'm not acting like myself, huh?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:20.467
If I became a Shepherd and read Suzuki's book...

00:13:20.467 --> 00:13:23.637
Do you still want to become a Shepherd?

00:13:23.637 --> 00:13:27.391
To the point where you'd erase your
time with Shirasaki and the others?

00:13:30.394 --> 00:13:31.979
Tomorrow's love fortune...

00:13:31.979 --> 00:13:35.274
If you pretend to bump into your love
interest by accident and ask him for advice,

00:13:35.274 --> 00:13:37.860
you might be able to get lovey dovey.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.236
By accident, huh?

00:13:42.364 --> 00:13:43.866
This is...!

00:13:48.829 --> 00:13:51.874
"Kana, I wonder if you can wander to the club
room tomorrow? (It's not supposed to be a joke!)"

00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:55.210
Kanasuke didn't come today, either.

00:13:57.629 --> 00:14:00.257
I wonder if she's depressed about the play...

00:14:00.257 --> 00:14:02.801
She worked really hard on it, huh?

00:14:02.801 --> 00:14:04.428
Yeah.

00:14:05.888 --> 00:14:10.184
Hey, Shirasaki, if there were a book with the
future written in it, would you want to read it?

00:14:10.184 --> 00:14:11.393
Huh?

00:14:13.854 --> 00:14:16.565
It'd be amazing if there were a book like that,

00:14:16.565 --> 00:14:20.068
but if I knew the future, I think
it'd keep me from doing anything.

00:14:20.068 --> 00:14:22.362
I don't think I'd read it.

00:14:24.948 --> 00:14:27.576
Yeah, that makes sense for Shirasaki.

00:14:27.576 --> 00:14:30.996
I know! Then I have to work harder, huh?

00:14:30.996 --> 00:14:37.127
Yeah, we'll help, too. We'll think
about what we can do to help Kanasuke.

00:14:37.127 --> 00:14:39.046
Thanks, Kakei.

00:14:39.046 --> 00:14:44.092
Hey, what if we ask Kana to
write another script for the event?

00:14:44.092 --> 00:14:47.638
That's a good idea.
I'm sure Kanasuke would like that!

00:14:47.638 --> 00:14:50.724
Yeah! I'll try emailing her about it.

00:14:53.352 --> 00:14:55.562
Shirasaki's strong...

00:14:57.898 --> 00:14:59.858
But I'm...

00:15:03.654 --> 00:15:05.447
K-Kakei!

00:15:05.447 --> 00:15:07.658
Wh-What a lucky accident!

00:15:07.658 --> 00:15:09.243
Are you on your way home?

00:15:10.244 --> 00:15:12.621
What are you doing, looking like that?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.542
A-Actually, I need your advice!

00:15:17.584 --> 00:15:18.293
"May 30th"

00:15:18.752 --> 00:15:23.799
It's probably just a prank,
but I thought I'd at least tell you about it.

00:15:24.299 --> 00:15:25.592
This email...

00:15:25.592 --> 00:15:26.593
"The Shepherd has decided"
...is from the Shepherd?

00:15:26.593 --> 00:15:29.096
"to eliminate the Library Club."
...is from the Shepherd?

00:15:30.722 --> 00:15:33.642
Did you send any emails
as the Shepherd recently?

00:15:33.642 --> 00:15:36.520
What? Don't get in the way of my work.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:40.190
Well, on the Library Club website,
there was an email from the Shepherd.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:42.192
I don't know anything about that.

00:15:42.192 --> 00:15:44.444
Oh, she moved! More to the right!

00:15:44.444 --> 00:15:46.822
Ow! Don't push on my ear!

00:15:46.822 --> 00:15:49.032
Isn't it just a prank?

00:15:49.032 --> 00:15:50.492
It wasn't Kodachi?

00:15:50.492 --> 00:15:52.870
Hey, focus on the mission!

00:15:53.495 --> 00:15:54.872
Too tight, too tight!

00:15:54.872 --> 00:15:58.000
Everyone's worrying about boring things...

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:01.086
They should think about
the one guiding them for once.

00:16:01.086 --> 00:16:05.757
Hey, why do you want to be a Shepherd, Kodachi?

00:16:05.757 --> 00:16:09.761
If I become a Shepherd,
I can read the books in the magic library

00:16:09.761 --> 00:16:13.390
and help everyone in the Library Club.

00:16:14.016 --> 00:16:19.855
That's true. And then everyone
will forget you. My condolences.

00:16:19.855 --> 00:16:20.814
That's...

00:16:20.814 --> 00:16:23.066
Well, worry about it as much as you want.

00:16:23.066 --> 00:16:26.320
Like that waitress of yours.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:28.113
Do you know something?

00:16:30.073 --> 00:16:32.951
You're panicking like an idiot.

00:16:32.951 --> 00:16:36.038
Hey, shall I do it to you again?

00:16:38.874 --> 00:16:40.501
Owww!

00:16:42.794 --> 00:16:45.172
The hill in Higashimachi.

00:16:45.172 --> 00:16:48.884
If you want to talk to her,
try going there before daybreak.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.852
"From: Tsugumi Shirasaki" "It's Shirasaki.
Do you think you can write a script for our next event?"

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.106
Kakei...

00:17:03.106 --> 00:17:04.191
How...?

00:17:04.191 --> 00:17:06.693
The Shepherd told me.

00:17:08.529 --> 00:17:11.865
Kakei, you see through everything, don't you?

00:17:11.865 --> 00:17:13.575
That's not true.

00:17:13.575 --> 00:17:15.827
I'm just a guy who read a ton of books

00:17:15.827 --> 00:17:19.498
because I wanted to know
how to get along with people.

00:17:19.498 --> 00:17:22.751
That's the first I've heard of it.

00:17:22.751 --> 00:17:26.296
It's my first time telling anyone.

00:17:26.296 --> 00:17:30.926
Then why don't I tell you something
I've never told anyone in return?

00:17:30.926 --> 00:17:35.222
Another story of "The Queen's New Clothes."

00:17:37.474 --> 00:17:42.271
In a certain town lived a girl and her friend.

00:17:42.271 --> 00:17:49.069
The girl was the clown of the
group of girls the two belonged to.

00:17:49.069 --> 00:17:54.616
Somehow, that became expected,
and the girl didn't challenge it at all.

00:18:20.893 --> 00:18:25.856
After seeing her friend betray
herself to return to the group,

00:18:25.856 --> 00:18:29.276
the girl decided that she would go at it alone.

00:18:31.361 --> 00:18:37.993
However, before long, the girl
met wonderful friends in a new place.

00:18:37.993 --> 00:18:42.623
But the girl had become very cowardly.

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:50.255
She didn't want to make waves
and just wanted to have fun.

00:18:50.255 --> 00:18:55.052
The kind people accepted her like that.

00:18:55.052 --> 00:18:57.221
She felt guilty.

00:18:57.221 --> 00:19:01.475
At this rate, she wouldn't
know her true self anymore.

00:19:01.475 --> 00:19:06.021
Even so, because she didn't want to lose
the place she had finally found for herself,

00:19:06.021 --> 00:19:09.316
the girl decided she
would continue her little dance.

00:19:10.651 --> 00:19:13.237
Doesn't it make you laugh?

00:19:13.237 --> 00:19:18.283
Someone like me shouldn't
be allowed to want anything.

00:19:19.701 --> 00:19:23.080
There is a book here.

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:28.418
To tell you the truth,
stray sheep cannot see it.

00:19:28.418 --> 00:19:31.463
It is a book with your future written in it.

00:19:32.756 --> 00:19:37.427
Don't worry. Your future is very bright.

00:19:37.427 --> 00:19:41.515
If you still become worried, it's all right.

00:19:41.515 --> 00:19:44.393
I will definitely help you.

00:19:44.393 --> 00:19:48.689
So don't give up on what you want.

00:19:49.523 --> 00:19:52.276
Even if it's... not like me...?

00:19:54.611 --> 00:19:57.781
Even so, my feelings will not change.

00:19:57.781 --> 00:20:00.284
I will accept you no matter how you are!

00:20:02.536 --> 00:20:04.997
I... I...

00:20:04.997 --> 00:20:08.625
I want to be true to myself!

00:20:18.177 --> 00:20:21.346
As long as I have you, Kakei, I'll be fine.

00:20:21.346 --> 00:20:24.266
I'll always be with you.

00:20:33.233 --> 00:20:37.446
Please! Please let me write another script!

00:20:37.446 --> 00:20:38.739
Kana!

00:20:38.739 --> 00:20:43.118
I might mess up,
but even so, I still want to do it!

00:20:43.118 --> 00:20:45.495
Okay! We're counting on you!

00:20:46.413 --> 00:20:47.873
Kana.

00:20:48.874 --> 00:20:51.001
You worry too much about what others think.

00:20:51.001 --> 00:20:53.212
You should do more of what you want.

00:20:53.212 --> 00:20:57.216
No one in the Library Club
will hate you for that.

00:20:57.216 --> 00:20:59.092
You should trust everyone
in the Library Club more...

00:20:59.092 --> 00:21:00.219
Trust <i>me </i>more...

00:21:02.221 --> 00:21:04.431
Senri, thank you.

00:21:04.431 --> 00:21:08.936
Kana, you aren't hiding as much of
your true self as you think, you know.

00:21:08.936 --> 00:21:12.648
If you keep trying to trick yourself,
I'm going to take Kakei for myself.

00:21:13.899 --> 00:21:15.692
See? You can't hide it.

00:21:25.285 --> 00:21:28.914
Misono, you were here after all.

00:21:28.914 --> 00:21:31.917
How long do you plan on
running away from your lessons?

00:21:31.917 --> 00:21:34.920
There's no time before the summer competition.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.339
You can't waste a minute.

00:21:37.339 --> 00:21:40.300
So you should quit the Library Club immediately!

00:21:51.228 --> 00:21:59.987
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>

00:21:59.987 --> 00:22:07.661
<i>While drifting aimlessly, I become an adult</i>

00:22:07.661 --> 00:22:17.504
<i>The time has come when days spent</i>
<i>running and playing seem far away</i>

00:22:17.504 --> 00:22:21.758
<i>The answer I gave here</i>

00:22:21.758 --> 00:22:34.688
<i>Oh, if only it had been</i>
<i>passed down somewhere</i>

00:22:34.688 --> 00:22:39.484
<i>For those crowds walking around lost</i>

00:22:39.484 --> 00:22:43.822
<i>It can be a light that shines on them</i>

00:22:43.822 --> 00:22:52.122
<i>On the other side of the</i>
<i>green belt that surrounds us</i>

00:22:52.122 --> 00:23:00.506
<i>You head toward endless tomorrows</i>

00:23:12.434 --> 00:23:14.228
He refused me again today.

00:23:14.228 --> 00:23:17.439
Kakei, how can I get you
to join the student council?

00:23:17.439 --> 00:23:19.441
It's because we don't have many girls.

00:23:19.441 --> 00:23:24.655
It's true that the Library Club is
probably more fun with all those cute girls.

00:23:24.655 --> 00:23:26.990
No, Kakei is not a ladies' man!

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:30.369
You never know. He might pretend to be
good but be going out with four girls at once...

00:23:30.369 --> 00:23:31.245
What are you saying?

00:23:31.245 --> 00:23:31.995
But then maybe I have a chance, too?

00:23:31.995 --> 00:23:34.248
"Next time: The Song Princess' Decision"
But then maybe I have a chance, too?

00:23:34.248 --> 00:23:37.003
"Next time: The Song Princess' Decision"
She's hopeless...
